#  AWS Data Pipeline Project – Amazon Product Analysis

## 📌 Project Overview
Designed and implemented an end-to-end data engineering pipeline on AWS to process, transform, query, and visualize Amazon product data. The project demonstrates ETL workflows, cloud data storage, data cataloging, SQL-based analytics, and interactive business dashboards.

---

## Architecture

Raw CSV Dataset
⬇
Amazon S3
⬇
AWS Glue Crawler
⬇
AWS Glue Data Catalog
⬇
AWS Glue ETL Job
⬇
Processed Data (Parquet in Amazon S3)
⬇
Amazon Athena
⬇
Amazon QuickSight Dashboard

---

##  AWS Services Used

- **Amazon S3** – Data Storage
- **AWS Glue Crawler** – Metadata Discovery
- **AWS Glue Data Catalog** – Table Management
- **AWS Glue ETL** – Data Transformation
- **Amazon Athena** – SQL Analytics
- **Amazon QuickSight** – Dashboard & Visualization

---

