## 📂 Dataset

- Amazon Products Dataset (Kaggle)

---

## ETL Workflow

1. Uploaded raw CSV dataset to Amazon S3
2. Created AWS Glue Crawler to catalog the dataset
3. Generated metadata in AWS Glue Data Catalog
4. Built and executed AWS Glue ETL Job
5. Stored transformed data in Parquet format on Amazon S3
6. Queried processed data using Amazon Athena
7. Built interactive dashboards using Amazon QuickSight

