## 📈 Key Insights

- Built a complete serverless AWS Data Pipeline
- Converted raw CSV data into optimized Parquet format
- Queried processed data using Amazon Athena
- Designed interactive dashboards in Amazon QuickSight
- Demonstrated end-to-end ETL workflow using AWS services

